---
/**
 * /tools/calorie-deficit-planner — 12-Week Weight Loss Planner
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * Target keywords:   "calorie deficit calculator", "weight loss planner"
 * Layout:            CalculatorLayout
